Dear [Hiring Manager Name / Hiring Manager],

I am excited to apply for the [Position Title] position at [Company Name]. With extensive experience managing multifamily construction projects throughout the Pacific Northwest and a deep understanding of podium-style construction, I am well-positioned to contribute to your multifamily portfolio and help deliver exceptional results for your clients.

My recent experience at STS Construction exemplifies my multifamily capabilities. As Project Manager, I led the complete delivery of 2210 Eastlake, a \$12M, 35,000 SF development featuring 57 units across 8 stories in Seattle's competitive Eastlake neighborhood. This Type III/V podium construction project (6 wood-frame stories over 2 concrete podium levels) required careful coordination of structural systems, building envelope details, and urban site logistics. I held full responsibility for project financials, team leadership, subcontractor coordination, and client relations, delivering the project with zero safety incidents while maintaining aggressive schedule targets.

Beyond 2210 Eastlake, my multifamily experience includes:

• **Hyatt Place Hotel & Apartments** (\$40M) - Mixed-use hospitality and multifamily development, achieving substantial completion 2 months early through Lean Construction implementation

• **Temple Lofts** (\$25M) - Historic adaptive reuse converting Masonic Temple to luxury loft apartments in Long Beach, including complex seismic retrofit

• **Various high-rise projects** - Building envelope experience on 255 S. King Street twin towers including curtain wall, precast, and insulated metal panel systems

I am particularly impressed by [Company Name]'s [specific aspect: portfolio of successful multifamily developments / commitment to sustainable construction practices / reputation in the Seattle market / innovative approach to housing solutions]. Your work on [specific project if known] demonstrates the quality and scale of projects I am eager to contribute to.

What sets me apart in multifamily construction is my combination of technical expertise in podium construction systems with strong capabilities in urban logistics, permit coordination, and stakeholder management. I understand the unique challenges of multifamily development - balancing architect and owner visions, coordinating multiple trades in tight sequences, managing value engineering decisions that impact both cost and livability, and maintaining strong neighborhood relations throughout construction.

I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my multifamily experience and project management approach can support [Company Name]'s continued success in this dynamic market. Thank you for your consideration.

Sincerely,
